OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid may not finish its term,
OL,4,AReform leader claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform's Welsh leader has said Plaid
OL,7,FCymru is at risk of not being able to
OL,8,Fcomplete its first four years in power.
OL,10,FThe party could not get its mid-year
OL,11,Fspending plans through the Senedd in
OL,12,Fthe summer, with no major opposition
OL,13,Fgroup offering support.
OL,15,FDespite First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,16,Fsaying he has learned lessons and Welsh
OL,17,FLabour leader Ken Skates indicating he
OL,18,Fwanted a budget deal with Plaid, Dan
OL,19,FThomas said it was "hard to see how
OL,20,Fthis Welsh government will last the
OL,21,Fduration of the term".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
